{"id":"H1256","lemma":"בְּרָאיָה","transliteration":"berayah","sayIt":"be-ra-yah","language":"Hebrew","partOfSpeech":"","gloss":"Beraiah","meaning":"A man of the tribe of Benjamin living at the time of Divided Monarchy, only mentioned at 1Ch.8.21;\nson of: Shimei (H8096N);\nbrother of: Jakim (H3356), Zichri (H2147H), Zabdi (H2067H), Elienai (H0462), Zillethai (H6769), Eliel (H0447H), Adaiah (H5718H) and Shimrath (H8119)\n§ Beraiah = \"Jehovah has created\"\nson of Shimhi, a chief man of Benjamin","glosses":["beraiah"],"count":1,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"1ch-8","v":21,"renderings":{"bsb":"Beraiah","kjv":"and Beraiah"}}],"elsewhere":[{"ref":"1 Chronicles 8:21","note":"Adaiah, Beraiah, Shimrath, the sons of Shimei,","source":"web"}],"related":[{"id":"H0447","lemma":"אֱלִיאֵל","transliteration":"eliel","gloss":"Eliel"},{"id":"H0462","lemma":"אֱלִיעֵינַי","transliteration":"elienay","gloss":"Elienai"},{"id":"H8096","lemma":"שִׁמְעִי","transliteration":"shimi","gloss":"Shimei"},{"id":"H3356","lemma":"יָקִים","transliteration":"yaqim","gloss":"Jakim"},{"id":"H2147","lemma":"זִכְרִי","transliteration":"zikhri","gloss":"Zichri"},{"id":"H2067","lemma":"זַבְדִּי","transliteration":"zavdi","gloss":"Zabdi"},{"id":"H6769","lemma":"צִלְּתַי","transliteration":"tsilltay","gloss":"Zillethai"},{"id":"H5718","lemma":"עֲדָיָ֫הוּ","transliteration":"adayah","gloss":"Adaiah"}],"sources":["STEPBible TBESH/TBESG lexicon (CC BY 4.0)","STEPBible TAHOT/TAGNT tagged text (CC BY 4.0)"]}